  STORE[0] ref
primed held proxy: read, weaken, undef the referent:
  FETCH[0]
  undef $t:
  DESTROY
  STORE[0] undef
  FETCH[0]
  after: defined via proxy = 0
  STORE[0] ref
unprimed held proxy: weaken (no-op on an undef slot), read (primes a strong copy), undef the referent:
  FETCH[0]
  undef $t2:
  after: defined via proxy = 1
  drop the proxy:
  DESTROY
which predicates FETCH (one call each on a fresh unprimed proxy):
  STORE[1] ref
  isweak:
  FETCH[1]
  blessed:
  FETCH[1]
  reftype:
  FETCH[1]
  refaddr:
  FETCH[1]
  readonly:
  FETCH[1]
  weaken:
  unweaken:
  defined:
  FETCH[1]
  ref:
  FETCH[1]
end
  DESTROY
